        "original_id": "0ebc98a1-72e2-5a4d-8bfb-e613bf0a1dbb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronaldinho, Samuel Eto'o, Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Christopher Lambert, Mike Tyson, Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson\n- Organizations: FC Barcelona, FIFA\n- Places: Ciutat Esportiva Joan Gamper\n- Works: Kickboxer: Retaliation\n- Topics: football awards, training grounds\n\nFacts:\n- Ronaldinho was named FIFA World Player of the Year for 2005 for the second consecutive time and received the highest points total ever for the award.\n- Samuel Eto'o finished third in the 2005 FIFA World Player of the Year voting.\n- Ronaldinho won two FIFA World Player of the Year awards and one Ballon d'Or.\n- Ronaldinho is often considered one of the best players of his generation and is regarded by many as one of the greatest footballers of all time.\n- The film Kickboxer: Retaliation stars Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Christopher Lambert, Ronaldinho, Mike Tyson, and Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson.\n- Ciutat Esportiva Joan Gamper is the training ground and academy base of FC Barcelona.",
